\newlabel{tab:dqn_family}{{6}{17}{Episode total cost across six DQN objectives in the five fully coupled regimes. Values are mean $\pm $ SD across 20 independently trained model-seed blocks after within-seed averaging of 20 shared held-out traces. Lower values are better, and the leading objective varies across regimes.\relax }{table.caption.11}{}}
